        "heading": "A family business in Oak Creek, WI.",
        "text": "<p>We're Kylee and Tyler Rude, a husband and wife team building our lives and business around Jesus Christ.</p><p>Through The Great Unknown Liquidation, our mission is to provide high-quality, brand-new merchandise at deeply discounted prices while leading with faith, honesty, and integrity.</p><p>Inspired by James 1:2\u20134, we believe God uses every season to strengthen our faith and build perseverance. We are committed to putting people before profit, supporting international missions, and using the opportunities God provides to serve others and bring glory to His name.</p>",
